---
import RootLayout from "../layouts/RootLayout.astro";
---

<RootLayout title="About Veltryx">
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-neutral-100">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6">About Veltryx</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-neutral-400">
            Founded in 2023 by Acto, Veltryx (since 2025, formerly ActoWeb) is a host provider delivering impactful solutions.
            <br><br>    
            We specialize in hosting and managing various projects, focusing on custom solutions development to meet specific organizational needs. We also like to experiment and explore creative ideas to push boundaries and innovate.
            <br><br>
            Our team is dedicated to providing high-quality services and ensuring that our clients' needs are met with excellence and   attention to detail.
            <br><br>
            Take a look at <a href="/projects" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">our projects</a> to explore the solutions we've developed and the work we've completed.
            <br><br>
            We are always looking for new opportunities to collaborate and create innovative solutions. If you have a project in mind or would like to work with us, please <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">reach out to us</a>.
        </p>
    </section>
</RootLayout>
